  "description": "TPO status:\r\n\r\n1) Horse Chestnut on boundary with Highgate Hill: Reduce major limbs by 4 metres to 1.5 metre above main stem to provide a structurally robust form; central stem has previously failed and created a decay pocket between two remaining major lateral limbs.\r\n\r\n2) Poplar: Remove lowest lateral limb towards Church; remove lowest lateral limb towards Highgate Hill; Reduce remaining crown by up to 3 metres; reduce away from Church to provide clearance. Tree is overgrown this work is routine maintenance. \r\n\r\n~\r\n\r\nConservation Area Status: \r\n\r\n3) Goat Willow: Remove to ground level; poison stump to prevent regrowth. Small willow with messy form, the parish aim to replant a fruit tree in it's place.",
